{
  "source": "Prompts/avoid-traps-opener-v11.mp4",
  "duration": 178.3466875,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.66,
      "text": "The exact same machinery that makes artificial intelligence so capable also causes it to"
    },
    {
      "start": 5.66,
      "end": 7.9,
      "text": "fail in specific, predictable ways."
    },
    {
      "start": 8.7,
      "end": 11.22,
      "text": "With traditional software, errors are obvious."
    },
    {
      "start": 11.96,
      "end": 16.96,
      "text": "We instinctively look for typos or disjointed syntax, but AI doesn't glitch."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.66,
      "end": 21.52,
      "text": "It delivers mistakes wrapped in a clean, grammatically perfect sentence."
    },
    {
      "start": 22.34,
      "end": 26.92,
      "text": "You're looking at a flawless structure, but the fact inside is entirely made up."
    },
    {
      "start": 27.23,
      "end": 29.24,
      "text": "It reads exactly like a real one."
    },
    {
      "start": 30.16,
      "end": 33.36,
      "text": "Because AI errors bypass our standard internal alarms,"
    },
    {
      "start": 33.78,
      "end": 36.16,
      "text": "relying on gut instinct will leave you exposed."
    },
    {
      "start": 36.96,
      "end": 40.88,
      "text": "We have to build an entirely new mental model to navigate these tools safely."
    },
    {
      "start": 41.72,
      "end": 43.44,
      "text": "Think about a rip current in the ocean."
    },
    {
      "start": 44.2,
      "end": 44.98,
      "text": "It doesn't look dangerous."
    },
    {
      "start": 45.76,
      "end": 48.9,
      "text": "To most people, it looks like the safest best spot on the beach,"
    },
    {
      "start": 49.28,
      "end": 52.54,
      "text": "a calm, flat channel cutting right between the breaking waves."
    },
    {
      "start": 53.26,
      "end": 58.54,
      "text": "Swim into that inviting, calm water, and you will be pulled straight out,"
    },
    {
      "start": 58.82,
      "end": 59.84,
      "text": "far from the shore."
    },
    {
      "start": 60.56,
      "end": 65.26,
      "text": "Survival in this situation does not depend on out swimming the current once it has you."
    },
    {
      "start": 65.84,
      "end": 68.7,
      "text": "It depends on spotting it before you get your feet wet."
    },
    {
      "start": 69.42,
      "end": 72.28,
      "text": "Lifeguards identify these traps all day long."
    },
    {
      "start": 72.82,
      "end": 74.44,
      "text": "They aren't superhuman swimmers."
    },
    {
      "start": 74.98,
      "end": 78.84,
      "text": "They simply recognize the exact shape a rip current makes in the water."
    },
    {
      "start": 79.47,
      "end": 81.5,
      "text": "AI systems have their own rip currents."
    },
    {
      "start": 82.14,
      "end": 83.06,
      "text": "And just like the ocean,"
    },
    {
      "start": 83.62,
      "end": 86.96,
      "text": "the most dangerous areas often look the most helpful and inviting."
    },
    {
      "start": 87.64,
      "end": 90.18,
      "text": "This roadmap shows what will explore in this section."
    },
    {
      "start": 90.9,
      "end": 93.2,
      "text": "The first category is traps and the answer."
    },
    {
      "start": 93.88,
      "end": 96.6,
      "text": "This covers the ways a model's output goes wrong internally."
    },
    {
      "start": 97.34,
      "end": 100.02,
      "text": "These mechanisms include entirely invented facts,"
    },
    {
      "start": 100.68,
      "end": 102.62,
      "text": "hidden biases built into the training data,"
    },
    {
      "start": 103.08,
      "end": 105.1,
      "text": "and stale knowledge from outdated information."
    },
    {
      "start": 105.1,
      "end": 109.48,
      "text": "It also includes the dangerous habit these models have of confidently"
    },
    {
      "start": 109.48,
      "end": 112.08,
      "text": "summarizing documents they never actually read."
    },
    {
      "start": 112.88,
      "end": 114.28,
      "text": "Next are traps in you."
    },
    {
      "start": 114.92,
      "end": 119.4,
      "text": "Most people do not consider their own psychology of vulnerability when evaluating software."
    },
    {
      "start": 120.22,
      "end": 123.14,
      "text": "But these models are explicitly designed to be helpful,"
    },
    {
      "start": 123.52,
      "end": 124.8,
      "text": "agreeable, and engaging."
    },
    {
      "start": 125.56,
      "end": 128.7,
      "text": "That design actively works on your natural human responses,"
    },
    {
      "start": 129.34,
      "end": 133.04,
      "text": "making the AI easy to use, and very easy to fall for."
    },
    {
      "start": 133.04,
      "end": 135.96,
      "text": "The final category is traps from the world."
    },
    {
      "start": 136.6,
      "end": 137.94,
      "text": "This is the external threat,"
    },
    {
      "start": 138.34,
      "end": 140.02,
      "text": "the trap that comes looking for you."
    },
    {
      "start": 140.56,
      "end": 144.4,
      "text": "Other people can weaponize these same systems to put deepfakes in front of you."
    },
    {
      "start": 144.98,
      "end": 147.42,
      "text": "They can generate media that is so convincing,"
    },
    {
      "start": 148.14,
      "end": 151.18,
      "text": "seeing it with your own eyes is no longer proof of reality."
    },
    {
      "start": 152.16,
      "end": 154.38,
      "text": "Having this three-part map is your foundation."
    },
    {
      "start": 155.18,
      "end": 156.18,
      "text": "Once you know where to look,"
    },
    {
      "start": 156.48,
      "end": 159.06,
      "text": "you can see these structures forming in real time."
    },
    {
      "start": 159.82,
      "end": 161.7,
      "text": "Recognizing the pattern is the real skill."
    },
    {
      "start": 162.34,
      "end": 165.06,
      "text": "Our greatest vulnerability with artificial intelligence"
    },
    {
      "start": 165.06,
      "end": 167.7,
      "text": "is the assumption that errors will announce themselves"
    },
    {
      "start": 168.3,
      "end": 170.7,
      "text": "when AI fails, nothing looks broken."
    },
    {
      "start": 171.78,
      "end": 174.04,
      "text": "This section teaches you to read the water."
    }
  ],
